# ~/.pi is this directory. Same whitelist approach as the Claude config: track
# settings, skills and prompts; ignore credentials, sessions and installed
# packages.
*
!.gitignore
!agent
agent/*
!agent/AGENTS.md
# Not agent/settings.json: pi writes lastChangelogVersion and the installed
# packages into it. step_agents renders it from this base.
!agent/settings.base.json
!agent/models.json
!agent/prompts
!agent/skills
!agent/skills/**
